Turned `@plone/aurora` into the Plone Aurora framework, in `packages/aurora`, with `@plone/aurora/vite` (`PloneAuroraVitePlugin()`, the Vite plugins and configuration of an app) and `@plone/aurora/registry.config` (the official add-ons). The app that develops Plone Aurora is now the private `@plone/aurora-dev`. Add-on repositories that run the core app have to use the new name. @sneridagh
